        <mxCell id="title" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:22px&quot;&gt;ETL Copilot — architecture&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px;color:#5A6B78&quot;&gt;Multi-agent assistant that turns a raw vendor CSV into a validated, documented table — with a human approval before anything runs&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#15212B;" vertex="1" parent="1">
